/* vi: set sw=4 ts=4:
 *
 * The profile engine (BTD-54): every profile of bxc-pki (BTD-64) applied
 * to each of the four IDIAL corpus CSRs (BTD-65); an issued certificate
 * has exactly the extensions of the golden file, in its order, with its
 * criticality and values, and its signature algorithm. Where a profile
 * refuses a CSR, the refusal and its code are part of the expectation.
 * The keygen profiles take a key generated by bxc-pki instead of a CSR.
 */

